            <ArticleTitle>Myocardial imaging using selective intracoronary injection of Thallium-201.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>124-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After selective coronary arteriography 150 muCi of Thallium-201 was injected into each coronary artery. Scintigraphy of the myocardium was performed about half an hour after the injection. In a series of ten patients the myocardium was clearly visualized in the gamma images. No adverse effects were noted.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
